- [x] MTA-STS cache, TLS reporting and Rspamd ARC integration hooks.
- [x] Scoped API authorization, OAuth introspection and domain/action compliance grants.
- [x] Compliance hold/copy/BCC, evidence export, retention/legal hold, atomic release and audit hash chains.
